chapter('01_EXECUTIVE_OVERVIEW.md','Executive overview',
 '**Overall: PARTIALLY AUDITED.** This combines the complete prior recovery corpus with new passive architecture evidence and a dedicated five-binary offline WASM analysis. No private server source,database session,authenticated browser or inaccessible conversation was obtained.\n\n'
 '## Major changes from the previous report\n\n'
 '- MySQL is no longer merely a hypothesis: a2024GoogleCloudarticle authored by a Chess.com principal engineer describes Cloud SQL for MySQL Enterprise Plus,with ScyllaDB,Elasticsearch and Redis also explicitly named. That is confirmed published usage,not a schema dump or guarantee of every current service.\n'
 '- Newly captured public web headers include `k8s-prod-fpm-catch-all` and matched route names. Together with public PHP/Symfony job evidence and generated routing conventions,PHP/Symfony are strongly indicated for the web tier. They are not established as the CEAC service implementation.\n'
 '- Four actual referenced stylesheets establish a custom cc-*design system,fonts,themes,tokens and breakpoints.367implementation declaration variants are indexed,not invented from appearance.\n'
 '- All five available WASM binaries were structurally parsed,validated,and instantiated under restricted conditions. Function indices/signatures,static direct-call graphs,opcode statistics,data layouts and offset-linked strings are retained.\n'
 '- CEE allocates an initial386MiBmemory,maximum2GiB,non-shared. A Stockfish no-Worker build imports fixed512MiBshared memory;the single build uses64MiBinitialnon-shared memory. Torch Lite uses512MiBfixednon-shared memory. These are declared limits,not claims about resident RAM or every productionclient.\n'
 '- Native `CEE_InitWithOpts(i32,i32)->void` and `CEE_NewFeature(i32,i32,i32,i32)->i32` disprove inference from JavaScript arity0. Ten focused export bodies were decompiled with explicit typed-stub limitations.\n\n'
 '## What is still not complete\n\nEvery function has structural accounting,but only selected export semantics were reviewed. Additional WASM versions/asset templates remain un-retrieved. Controllers,repositories,actual SQLtables/columns,exact cloud rating/accuracy algorithms and server configuration remain unavailable. Generating every requested report is not completion of those investigations.\n\n'+tab(['Metric','Actual'],COUNTS.items()))
