 '- [Previous master index](history/prior-audit/00_MASTER_INDEX.md)\n- [Granular prior knowledge](history/prior-audit/03_RECOVERED_KNOWLEDGE.md)\n- [Full historical/failed work](history/prior-audit/17_HISTORICAL_FINDINGS.md)\n- [13prior contradictions/version distinctions](history/prior-audit/19_CONTRADICTIONS_AND_DUPLICATES.md)\n- [New detailed findings](findings/FINDINGS_INDEX.md)\n- [Combined finding ledger](audit-metadata/findings-ledger.jsonl)\n\n'
