chapter('09_UI_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md','Design system and CSS architecture',
 'Four actually referenced public stylesheets were fetched successfully:design-system-global,main-global,alerts-global and logged-out-navigation-global. They supply1,240CSSvariabledeclarations,612uniquevariablenames(calculatedexactvalueisinmetrics),52mediaqueries and full selector contexts. See the machine metrics rather than relying on this explanatory label if extraction is extended.\n\n'
 '## Directly observed examples\n\n- Main global CSS sets`html{font-size:62.5%}`;`body`uses1.4rem,line-height1.43,zero margin,and`var(--font-family-system)`. Rem units therefore derive from a10pxbase only when browser defaultfont-sizeis16px;userpreferencescanchangeit.\n- `--color-green-400:#5D9948`;primarybackgroundreferencesgraytokens rather than a globally fixed color. Repeated text/defaultvariableshave different scoped values.\n- `--font-family-system:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",system-ui,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif`;headingfamily`"Chess Sans",sans-serif`. Saved HTML preloadsChessSansBold/ExtraBold andchessglyphfontfiles. Fontpreloadisnotproofeveryfacewasdownloaded.\n- Navigation style exports collapsed5.6rem/default17remwidths and max/minbreakpointvalues,includingmin768=48em,min1024=64em.\n- cc-buttonstyles usegradients,color-mix,enabled/hoveredtokens,insetandexternalshadows;modalmotionusesnamed durations/easing.\n- CSSvariables,customcomponentclasses,theme-scopedoverrides andexportedbreakpoints establish a customdesignsystem. Genericframeworkidentityisnotestablished. Compiled`:export`blocksarecompatiblewithCSSModules/Sasspipelines,notproofthatallstyleswereauthoredinSass.\n\n[Full variable values,cascade occurrences,selectors,mediaqueries,fonts and exports](registries/design-system.json)\n')
